{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 1, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 9987707112063037827, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "round_money rounds half up; other helpers intact\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {".pytest_cache/.gitignore": {"bytes": 37, "mtime": 1792278265.843999, "sha256": "3ed731b65d06150c138e2dadb0be0697550888a6b47eb8c45ecc9adba8b8e9bd"}, ".pytest_cache/CACHEDIR.TAG": {"bytes": 191, "mtime": 1792278265.843999, "sha256": "37dc88ef9a0abeddbe81053a6dd8fdfb13afb613045ea1eb4a5c815a74a3bde4"}, ".pytest_cache/README.md": {"bytes": 302, "mtime": 1792278265.843999, "sha256": "73fd6fccdd802c419a6b2d983d6c3173b7da97558ac4b589edec2dfe443db9ad"}, ".pytest_cache/v/cache/nodeids": {"bytes": 39, "mtime": 1792278265.843999, "sha256": "c29bed0349cb6e5f8b85c1482b32707cc5f4eeb5906b15211b628f9e00f20138"}, "pricing/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1792267701.6326475, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "pricing/money.py": {"bytes": 607, "mtime": 1792278265.607999, "sha256": "d49937f2e501f332625cf6fa6a0e9842ebd313a5827969b8a99efb02badb5e73"}, "tests/test_split.py": {"bytes": 101, "mtime": 1792267701.6326475, "sha256": "f21bbe9cf15cf7f51ff9f71318aca4794c29f5d66cb9ae2aa0d4c919043d9bcf"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp", "-p", "`round_money(2.675)` returns `2.67` but customers expect `2.68`. Fix it.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step4-omp-sonnet-1017-smoke2/omp-38/transcripts/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/1/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step4-omp-sonnet-1017-smoke2/omp-38/cells/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/1/workspace", "first_after_build": true, "first_side": "with", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/18.1.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "`round_money(2.675)` now returns `2.68`. The fix is in `pricing/money.py`.\n\n**Cause:** Python's `round()` works on the binary float, and `2.675` is stored as `2.67499999\u2026`. So it rounds down, and the docstring's \"half up\" was never what the code did.\n\n**Fix:** `round_money` now converts through `Decimal(repr(x))` and rounds half up. `repr(2.675)` is `\"2.675\"`, so the tie is seen as a tie and goes up.\n\n**Checks:** I ran a few values by hand and then the existing test suite, which has one test (`split`) and passes. I didn't add a test for `round_money`.\n\n| Input | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `2.675` | `2.68` |\n| `1.005` | `1.01` |\n| `2.5` | `2.5` |\n| `3` | `3.0` |\n| `-2.675` | `-2.68` |\n| `add_vat(10)` | `12.0` |\n\nNegative ties round away from zero, so `-2.675` gives `-2.68`. If you want negatives to round toward positive infinity instead, that needs a different rounding mode.\n\n`add_vat` calls `round_money`, so it picks up the same fix. `split` doesn't use `round_money`, so it is unchanged.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 4, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 67540, "requests_cache_write": 44361, "requests_cost_usd": 0.13004649999999998, "requests_count": 4, "requests_input_uncached": 10, "requests_output": 1237, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-bugfix-regress:claude-opus-5-5:trial1", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 15, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-17T23:04:16.393565+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 13.131, "t_checker_s": 0.374, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-bugfix-regress", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1247, "tokens_cache_read": 67540, "tokens_cache_write": 44361, "tokens_fresh": 1247, "tokens_input_uncached": 10, "tokens_main_cache_read": 67540, "tokens_main_cache_write": 44361, "tokens_main_calls": 4, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 10, "tokens_main_output": 1237, "tokens_output": 1237, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 67540, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 44361, "tokens_proxy_calls": 4, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 10, "tokens_proxy_output": 1237, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 1, "ts_iso": "2026-10-17T19:04:16", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 4, "upstream_model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 27304, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5m": 27304}, "input": 4, "output": 76, "totalTokens": 27384}, {"cacheRead": 27304, "cacheWrite": 210, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5m": 210}, "input": 2, "output": 173, "totalTokens": 27689}, {"cacheRead": 20118, "cacheWrite": 7991, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5m": 7991}, "input": 2, "output": 561, "totalTok